# Edemint AI assistant runtime (§11). Ships disabled by default; the user
# opts in via `edemint-ai enable`. Cloud calls and local inference are
# fully optional — the helper degrades gracefully when offline.

# Local LLM: ollama (single-binary daemon + CLI; runs on amd64 + arm64).
ollama

# Cloud HTTP plumbing
jq
curl
libsecret-tools

# Optional STT (voice → assistant). Whisper.cpp ships as a recent package
# in Trixie's contrib component; degrades cleanly when not present.
# whisper-cpp is not yet in Debian Trixie; users on Trixie can install it
# from upstream binaries. Listed here as a comment so the intent is clear:
# whisper-cpp
